namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamRectBlock {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamRectBlock.h#DreamRectBlock
    src   "UV channel-\n            UV0: full 0~1 UV coordinate for calculate sdf\n            UV1: Default DreamCanvas use, check DreamCanvas\n            UV2: Body texture's coordinate\n            UV3: X- for RectBlock data coordinate"
    text  "UV 通道-\n            UV0：用于计算 sdf 的完整 0~1 UV 坐标\n            UV1：DreamCanvas 默认使用，参见 DreamCanvas\n            UV2：主体纹理的坐标\n            UV3：X- 用于 RectBlock 数据坐标"
    state machine
}

DreamRectBlock:BodyGradient {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamRectBlock.h#DreamRectBlock:BodyGradient
    src   "What the body is filled with in place of BodyColor while bEnableBodyGradient is on, times its texture: a gradient of up\nto FDreamGradient::MaxStops stops, linear, radial, angle (Conic), diamond, reflected or four corners -- the gradient a\ntext paints with, drawn from the same rows. With no stops it is the two-colour gradient rect blocks had before\n(BodyGradientColor at BodyGradientCenter to BodyColor at BodyGradientRadius, turned by BodyGradientRotation), as the two\nstops GetEffectiveBodyGradient makes of it; the first edit in the editor writes those stops here, and the .dui line it\nwrites takes the place of the two-colour lines."
    text  "当bEnableBodyGradient开启时，用于替代BodyColor填充主体的内容，并与其纹理相乘：一个最多含FDreamGradient::MaxStops个色标的渐变，可为线性、径向、角度（锥形）、菱形、反射或四角——即\n文本绘制所用的渐变，由同一批数据行绘制。没有色标时，它就是矩形块此前的双色渐变\n（从BodyGradientCenter处的BodyGradientColor到BodyGradientRadius处的BodyColor，由BodyGradientRotation旋转），也就是\nGetEffectiveBodyGradient由此生成的两个色标；在编辑器中的首次编辑会把这些色标\n写入此处，其写入的.dui行\n将取代原来的双色行。"
    state machine
}

DreamRectBlock:BodyGradientColor {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamRectBlock.h#DreamRectBlock:BodyGradientColor
    src   "The two-colour gradient's colour, centre (from the rect's bottom left), radius and turn, and the units of the two:\nread from what was written before BodyGradient had stops, and drawn while it has none. Not shown in the editor; their\nsetters are deprecated."
    text  "双色渐变的颜色、中心（以矩形的左下角为基准）、半径和旋转角度，以及这两者的单位：\n从BodyGradient还没有色标时所写入的内容读取，并在其没有色标时绘制。不在编辑器中显示；其\nsetter已弃用。"
    state machine
}

DreamRectBlock:BodyTextureMargin {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamRectBlock.h#DreamRectBlock:BodyTextureMargin
    src   "The nine-slice margins, in TEXTURE pixels: how much of each edge keeps its own size instead of\nstretching. Ignored in Image mode.\n\nTexture pixels rather than a fraction, because that is the number an artist actually has -- a\nbutton skin's border is eight pixels wide in the file, and it stays eight whatever the texture\nis later resized to. The shader is handed both this and the fraction it works out to, because\nit cannot ask a texture how big it is without a fetch it does not otherwise need."
    text  "九宫格边距，以纹理像素为单位：每条边有多少保持自身尺寸而不被\n拉伸。在Image模式下忽略。\n\n使用纹理像素而非比例，因为这才是美术实际拥有的数值——\n按钮皮肤在文件中的边框宽八像素，无论纹理\n之后被缩放到多大，它都保持八像素。着色器会同时收到这个值和它换算出的比例，因为\n着色器若不进行一次它本来并不需要的取值，就无法知道纹理有多大。"
    state machine
}

DreamRectBlock:BorderGradient {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamRectBlock.h#DreamRectBlock:BorderGradient
    src   "What the border is drawn in place of BorderColor while bEnableBorderGradient is on: as BodyGradient is for the body."
    text  "当bEnableBorderGradient开启时，用于替代BorderColor绘制边框的内容：与BodyGradient之于主体渐变的作用相同。"
    state machine
}

DreamRectBlock:BorderGradientColor {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamRectBlock.h#DreamRectBlock:BorderGradientColor
    src   "The border's two-colour gradient, as BodyGradientColor and the rest are the body's."
    text  "边框的双色渐变，正如 BodyGradientColor 等是主体的双色渐变。"
    state machine
}

DreamRectBlock:bRaycastSupportCornerRadius {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamRectBlock.h#DreamRectBlock:bRaycastSupportCornerRadius
    src   "When do raycast interaction, will the CornerRadius be considered? Only support RaycastType.Rect."
    text  "进行射线检测交互时，是否考虑 CornerRadius？仅支持 RaycastType.Rect。"
    state machine
}

DreamRectBlock:bSoftEdge {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamRectBlock.h#DreamRectBlock:bSoftEdge
    src   "Prevent edge aliasing, useful when in 3d."
    text  "防止边缘锯齿，在 3D 场景中很有用。"
    state machine
}

DreamRectBlock:CornerRadius {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamRectBlock.h#DreamRectBlock:CornerRadius
    src   "DreamGUI_Hidden on every *UnitMode below, the body's texture mode and texture, and bUniformSetCornerRadius: the\ndetails panel edits each on another property's row -- the unit button beside a value, the Texture/Sprite switch and\npicker heading the body's texture group, the lock on the corner radius (FDreamRectBlockCustomization)."
