DreamRectBlock:GetEffectsAsLayerStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamRectBlock.h#DreamRectBlock:GetEffectsAsLayerStyle
    src   "Its own shadows, border and gradient written as a layer style: the outer shadow as a drop shadow, the inner shadow as an inner\nshadow, the border as an inside stroke (its gradient as the stroke's), the body gradient as a radial gradient overlay. The\nsame four effects, a second way to write them; the rect block draws them itself, and a layer style on its widget adds to them."
    text  "将其自身的阴影、边框和渐变写为图层样式：外阴影作为投影，内阴影作为内\n阴影，边框作为内描边（其渐变作为描边的渐变），主体渐变作为径向渐变叠加。\n同样这四种效果，另一种写法；矩形块自己绘制它们，控件上的图层样式则叠加在其上。"
    state machine
}

DreamRectBlock:SetEffectsFromLayerStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamRectBlock.h#DreamRectBlock:SetEffectsFromLayerStyle
    src   "The reverse: InStyle's first drop shadow, inner shadow, stroke and gradient overlay written into this rect block's own\nshadows, border and gradient, each turned off where InStyle has none. What those cannot say -- a blend mode, a contour,\nnoise, a stroke outside the edge -- is dropped; the effects of other kinds are not read."
    text  "反向操作：将InStyle的第一个投影、内阴影、描边和渐变叠加写入此矩形块自身的\n阴影、边框和渐变，InStyle没有的则各自关闭。这些属性无法表达的内容——混合模式、轮廓、\n噪波、边缘之外的描边——会被丢弃；其他类型的特效不会被读取。"
    state machine
}

